    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, that seems a bit harsh. Aren't they just arguing that local bonds need to be strong for a society to function? You're saying it's \"fundamentally flawed,\" but isn't there a legitimate sociological perspective that social cohesion requires a shared sense of belonging? Why is the student's view being dismissed so quickly?",
